      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi><mi>cu</mi></msub><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>=</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>295</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi></math>, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi><mi>steel</mi></msub><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>=</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>420</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi></math>",
